WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.594
In two minutes, you will have a live neighborhood contest, with its own link and QR code.

00:00:05.594 --> 00:00:06.286
Let's start.

00:00:07.192 --> 00:00:10.478
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:14.924
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:14.924 --> 00:00:17.423
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:17.423 --> 00:00:18.774
Tap Use my location.

00:00:20.618 --> 00:00:22.986
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:22.986 --> 00:00:23.683
Tap Allow.

00:00:27.771 --> 00:00:29.517
The map zooms to where you are.

00:00:29.517 --> 00:00:33.611
There are no events on your street, so tap Show all of Southern California.

00:00:35.737 --> 00:00:40.880
Now every place shows how far away it is, nearest first, so you can plan your drive.

00:00:43.162 --> 00:00:45.528
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:45.528 --> 00:00:46.682
See the three dots?

00:00:46.682 --> 00:00:47.202
Tap them.

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:50.531
In the menu, tap Add.

00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:53.601
Three choices.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:54.727
Tap A contest.

00:00:56.673 --> 00:00:57.963
Name your contest.

00:00:57.963 --> 00:00:59.796
Type a name, then tap Next.

00:01:03.131 --> 00:01:04.269
Who is running it?

00:01:04.269 --> 00:01:06.963
Type the name, pick your city, then tap Next.

00:01:10.099 --> 00:01:12.705
This welcome message is already written.

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:14.104
Keep it, and tap Next.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:17.920
A website is optional.

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:19.492
Skip it, and tap Next.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.805
These dates are filled in for you.

00:01:23.805 --> 00:01:24.351
Tap Next.

00:01:26.539 --> 00:01:27.918
Choose Quick start.

00:01:27.918 --> 00:01:30.055
It sets everything up for you.

00:01:30.055 --> 00:01:31.020
Then tap Next.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.541
Check your details, and tap Create contest.

00:01:39.382 --> 00:01:41.013
Your contest is live!

00:01:41.013 --> 00:01:42.645
Tap Open my dashboard.

00:01:44.641 --> 00:01:49.041
This is your dashboard, with your link and QR code, ready to share.

00:01:50.443 --> 00:01:53.438
Next up: Create a contest with Customize.
